{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2026-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1789516800, "end_date": 1790121599, "month_true_total": 160, "quota": 12, "returned": 12, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:05:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "235852950", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971815445", "personaname": "bobwallett", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971815445/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 876, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 746, "playtime_at_review": 530, "last_played": 1791320427, "avatar": "3d683c25e32ab5bff33c44143da8742d79da3fef"}, "language": "english", "review": "less than 1 hour in.  have been stuck on a tiny lip of a wall and walked through some stairs.  so far not impressed by the graphical glitches.  shooting is still solid and seems a touch easier, on normal.  few control issues. Still as good as ever, since 4 at least.  It is an AA game so don't expect the world's best graphics or animation but for a sale price, this was at least as good as the last two numbered games.  I hope they introduce a flop death animation in the next one for headshots as it's a bit too dramatic right now.", "timestamp_created": 1790103695, "timestamp_updated": 1790796669, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32693", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070", "vram_size": 8017}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235835718", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025724682", "personaname": "Kriste®", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/krixer/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21, "last_played": 1790270909, "avatar": "f05078aef280b9317cafb9c8c69accaf68b28da3"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm giving this a recommend [u] only [/u] if you [u] don't [/u] have Sniper Elite 5, and it's [u] on sale. [/u]\nThis game has no meaningfull improvements compared to S.E 5 - The graphics are the same, the x-ray system is the same, even every aspect of the menu is the same. [b] This is by every metric a standalone expansion to Sniper Elite 5. [/b] \nSo if you don't have the last one don't buy this. Buy the 5th first. \nIf you already have S.E 5 and you want more missions and different weapons, beware that this is only worth it at a significant discount.", "timestamp_created": 1790088685, "timestamp_updated": 1790088685, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235833632", "author": {"steamid": "76561199486893758", "personaname": "outofmyjourd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/outofmyjourd/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1125, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 727, "playtime_at_review": 397, "last_played": 1791331168, "avatar": "cc130acc9824b021a853765085d7eff788b524cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "its dope", "timestamp_created": 1790086720, "timestamp_updated": 1790086720, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31797", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 15977}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235818625", "author": {"steamid": "76561199587599348", "personaname": "HANKTHETANK187", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199587599348/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1816, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 161, "playtime_at_review": 1571, "last_played": 1791323078, "avatar": "a4aae85cbb4ab3505a86efae495f06c9c14843a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "great overall game. stays true to the OG aspect of sniper elite and brings cool and fun multiplayer gameplay.", "timestamp_created": 1790067639, "timestamp_updated": 1790067639, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235810250", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042066442", "personaname": "HazMatt19", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Craft_Beer_Matt/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 2649, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 716, "playtime_at_review": 1881, "last_played": 1791325737, "avatar": "7ff8554d274095f4ebcb5190fa113618684fa658"}, "language": "english", "review": "Shooting Nazis repeatedly in the face and nuts is criminally underrated. I've been playing the Sniper Elite series since the beginning, it never gets old!", "timestamp_created": 1790052904, "timestamp_updated": 1790052904, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "64681", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT", "vram_size": 16337}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235793222", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086351411", "personaname": "skpManiac", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/skpManiac/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 207, "playtime_forever": 2759, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1515, "playtime_at_review": 2405, "last_played": 1791499596, "avatar": "c1876c2ff54919ee54e132ada89a6ed063bf1155"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played all the sniper games and I love them, mostly because you can play it how YOU want to play. All guns blazing or stealth, and hide the bodies, disable the alarms, or leave the dead on the street and let them hit the alarms to get more kills :) \nThe issues I have with this one is it just feels like the last game without much extra work done on it, even the music is laborious and repetitive. Level 4 is level 2 all over again, like the devs couldn't be bothered  creating another level. \nI do love the fact that the soldiers can walk away from their post and go looking for you, even on the other side of the map, which adds more realism. \nI have encountered a few glitches, and I just redid level 4 as the screenshot did not work on the gnome, and when I replayed it, I was unable to finish it because there were no satchel charges anywhere to blow up the safes :(  I had to end the mission without finishing it which was very annoying as I had stealth killed most of the enemies, that progress was lost! \n\nJust buy it on sale as I did and it's worth the money then.\n\nJust finished the game with all collectibles done, I missed a few of the bloody gnomes though. \nSuch a weak and anticlimactic ending, the next to end level was very small and the very last level was just one shot at a guy on a bike, very disappointed with the ending, it needed more OOMPH! \n\nIt shows 40 hours playtime but I reckon about 8 of those hours were replaying the same bits because it did not save which is really annoying!", "timestamp_created": 1790028035, "timestamp_updated": 1791320316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "130864", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 285K", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090", "vram_size": 32187}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235792597", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044943297", "personaname": "Phil", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044943297/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 129, "playtime_forever": 318, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 173, "playtime_at_review": 145, "last_played": 1791407401, "avatar": "41f2fd25f17b3020fcacb8529bb87e61e786217f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its very very very similar to the last few. Looks pretty good, nice set design etc. buuuuut the characters are a bit naff and lots of the gameplay needs stealth rather than sniping.", "timestamp_created": 1790027328, "timestamp_updated": 1790027328, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235761936", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255427887", "personaname": "Monster Energy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198255427887/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 5928, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "